{"id":"9C","title":"Labor Sabbath","part":{"n":9,"title":"Feasts and observances"},"url":"/law/09-feasts-and-observances/9c","entries":[{"id":"9C.1","text":"The Sabbath as a time of rest from work was instituted by God.","refs":[{"book":"Genesis","chapter":2,"verses":"2-3"},{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":4,"verses":"4"}],"citation":"Gen. 2:2-3; Heb. 4:4."},{"id":"9C.2","text":"The Sabbath to be kept holy.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":20,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Exodus","chapter":31,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Exodus","chapter":35,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":5,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":56,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":17,"verses":"22"},{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":20,"verses":"16,20"}],"citation":"Exod. 20:8; Exod. 31:14; Exod. 35:2; Deut 5:12; Isa. 56:2; Jer. 17:22; Ezek. 20:16, 20."},{"id":"9C.3","text":"Six days of the week are to be used for labor, and the seventh day to be a Sabbath of rest in which you shall do no work. Exod. 16:22-30; Exod. 20:9-11; Exod. 23:12; Exod. 31:15; Exod. 34:21; Exod. 35:2; Lev, 23:3;","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":5,"verses":"13-14"},{"book":"Nehemiah","chapter":13,"verses":"15-22"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":17,"verses":"22"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":23,"verses":"56"}],"citation":"Deut 5:13-14; Neh. 13:15-22; Jer. 17:22; Luke 23:56."},{"id":"9C.4","text":"Sabbaths commanded to be kept.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":31,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"3,30"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":26,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":5,"verses":"15"}],"citation":"Exod. 31:14; Lev. 19:3, 30; Lev. 26:2; Deut. 5:15."},{"id":"9C.5","text":"Keeping the Sabbath is a sign of a covenant with God.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":31,"verses":"13"},{"book":"Exodus","chapter":31,"verses":"16-17"},{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":20,"verses":"15,20"}],"citation":"Exod. 31:139 16-17; Ezek. 20:15, 20."},{"id":"9C.6","text":"No buying, selling or marketing is to transpire on the Sabbath.","refs":[{"book":"Nehemiah","chapter":10,"verses":"31"},{"book":"Nehemiah","chapter":13,"verses":"15-22"}],"citation":"Neh.10:31; Neh. 13:15-22."},{"id":"9C.7","text":"No house work to be done on the Sabbath.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":35,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"Exod. 35:3."},{"id":"9C.8","text":"No burdens to be carried on during the Sabbath.","refs":[{"book":"Nehemiah","chapter":13,"verses":"19"},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":17,"verses":"21-22,27"}],"citation":"Neh. 13:19; Jer. 17:21-22, 27."},{"id":"9C.9","text":"The Sabbath was made for man, and not man for the Sabbath.","refs":[{"book":"Mark","chapter":2,"verses":"27"}],"citation":"Mark 2:27."},{"id":"9C.10","text":"Christ is Lord of the Sabbath.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":12,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Mark","chapter":2,"verses":"28"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":6,"verses":"5"}],"citation":"Matt. 12:8; Mark 2:28; Luke 6:5."},{"id":"9C.11","text":"Provide for food needed on the Sabbath in advance so it need not be gathered or bought or cooked on the Sabbath.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":16,"verses":"5"},{"book":"Exodus","chapter":16,"verses":"22-30"},{"book":"Exodus","chapter":35,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"Exod. 16:51 22-30; Exod. 35:3."},{"id":"9C.12","text":"We are not to seek our own pleasure on the Sabbath.","refs":[{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":58,"verses":"13"}],"citation":"Isa. 58:13."},{"id":"9C.13","text":"Divine worship to be celebrated on the Sabbath (a time for holy convocation).","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":23,"verses":"3"},{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":46,"verses":"3"},{"book":"Acts","chapter":16,"verses":"13"},{"book":"Acts","chapter":18,"verses":"4"}],"citation":"Lev. 23:3; Ezek. 46:3; Acts 16:13; Acts 18:4."},{"id":"9C.14","text":"The Scriptures to be read to the people on the Sabbath day.","refs":[{"book":"Acts","chapter":13,"verses":"14-15,27-44"},{"book":"Acts","chapter":15,"verses":"21"},{"book":"Acts","chapter":17,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"Acts 13:14-15, 27- 44; Acts 15:21; Acts 17:2."},{"id":"9C.15","text":"Works connected with religious service are lawful on the Sabbath.","refs":[{"book":"Numbers","chapter":28,"verses":"9"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":12,"verses":"5"},{"book":"John","chapter":7,"verses":"23"}],"citation":"Num. 28:9; Matt. 12:5; John 7:23."},{"id":"9C.16","text":"Good deeds and works of mercy are lawful on the Sabbath.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":12,"verses":"11-12"},{"book":"Mark","chapter":3,"verses":"1-5"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":6,"verses":"6-10"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":13,"verses":"10-13"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":14,"verses":"1-4"},{"book":"John","chapter":5,"verses":"8-16"},{"book":"John","chapter":9,"verses":"14"}],"citation":"Matt. 12:11-12; Mark 3:1-5; Luke 6:6-10; Luke 13:10-13; Luke 14:1-4; John 5:8-16; John 9:14."},{"id":"9C.17","text":"Acts needed to sustain life may be performed on the Sabbath.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":12,"verses":"1-5"},{"book":"Mark","chapter":2,"verses":"23-26"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":6,"verses":"1-4"}],"citation":"Matt. 12:1-5; Mark 2:23-26; Luke 6:1-4."},{"id":"9C.18","text":"Acts of necessity may be performed on the Sabbath.","refs":[{"book":"Luke","chapter":13,"verses":"15"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":14,"verses":"5"},{"book":"John","chapter":7,"verses":"22-23"}],"citation":"Luke 13:15; Luke 14:5; John 7:22-23."},{"id":"9C.19","text":"You honor God in observing the Sabbath.","refs":[{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":58,"verses":"13-14"}],"citation":"Isa. 58:13-14."}]}